### Persistence

Authenticated customer cart data must be synchronized with the backend and persisted in MongoDB Atlas.

A guest cart may use appropriate browser storage for temporary persistence, but browser storage is never the authority for price, stock, discount or order creation.

After login, merge cart items through a validated backend workflow.

Refreshing the page must not unexpectedly destroy the cart when the underlying items remain valid.

Do not trust client-supplied prices or totals.

